n></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvhvkj8XXkfmeUIAXBeHANHcPBPmSq3HpA3lmejGF7fhNQcWLoTQRkicPEWq0iaLkySdIsia1XwniagtsnyYevicM8YFbXjDV5MH69yk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvgNAQDbOWDCJlutLmT2FsvzeGqQreCu9KnY3uiaVd8ib3gyj0b0dibQ4v5lDOH9rS8BHUDjlEJxzvrvPWPyiav5lQOicxgyJrWWLVC0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nviaAplYicWFe4GAbo10H2Wz5LoNrYmuQ6uqS93VwkXycp05IKJOWFeJ4TBvicZICugVa7SpVZpoYExSibT7KQLPGNEd8UjiacUKnbL0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>中国科学院武汉岩土力学研究所创建于1958年，坐落在著名的武汉东湖之滨和风景秀丽的珞珈山西麓，是中国科学院从事岩土力学基础与应用研究、以工程应用背景为特征的专业研究机构。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>武汉岩土所拥有全国重点实验室、中国科学院工程实验室、应急管理部重点实验室、湖北省重点实验室、湖北省技术创新中心、湖北省工程技术研究中心、产业化转移转化平台等10个创新平台。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>建所近70年来，几代岩土所人不懈努力，勇攀高峰，面向国民经济的主战场，服务国家重大工程，完成涉及水利水电、能源、资源、交通、市政、海洋与国防等众多领域700多项重大研究项目，获省部级以上成果奖近300项（其中国家科技奖励和省部级一等奖97项），授权专利近5000项，专著与译著129部，计算机软件著作登记权3000余项，主办/承办3个SCI/EI收录的领军期刊，为岩土力学学科发展和国民经济建设作出了巨大贡献。</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvg8wXMfAEQOGYGmPCrvFkialu5RT88Gwaic3DjRicZmfb6XIicuLlXMC02HhrQGpWgbic3VSPA2mmLvJxI4MWYribUNWE7SbWMicdvdMw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科建设</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvhPArS8rkThDia1vNicBBzfoE6q2ibYTFnDEx7IJ8fACZ0wG14icibeFw6iaOiceFpIILqr8SEcITohKyiaRYHt8ZianvPn3TWVAEvAbt5g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nviayDa51DBzibA7jh5wWCx6USSGkoCuY3swUhtjlN9D8xPpIRgc6AowhVo6hkqHMtbEJsm6sBhOicOJ61zVy1P5Isicmjdc2icQrfqM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/1SZ0Q6P3nvhN1Ho4GBv5991EBxqibBExRX3kyqfPvkZrWjQ0iaRZgQ2qEO8eVtG6YoeZBj7Yo0IA0WmMg2oz3osVgJOb7MxknI8NicgavUYp5I/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvjmqbL2v0Cwx5biaPOfcJibmhticq91YdvyHx3tcgKsK0ZHRx2Hbum0G1MmGPJ0HRsGqGUaBJbS0B9RpaicicdWoFqN2OqM58ok0ibqE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>武汉岩土所拥有一批享誉国内外的科学家和高素质研究人才，其中中国工程院院士1人，国家杰青等国家级杰出人才19人，国家优青等国家级青年人才16人，高级岗位人员近200人。拥有国家自然科学基金委创新研究群体、中国科学院国家大科学计划培育专项等多个高水平科研团队，是科技部的创新人才培养示范基地。武汉岩土所具有博士生导师、硕士生导师资格审批权，现有博士生导师72人，硕士生导师65人。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvjia2lyEZ8oT8N8LMHFZuTaPfv2UYEzFibkhwhKsqFs7qDS6ChOt1yLnHIYFI7POMmcMPOxNfjLRPnvj6VqwAvDk9wqTr8wj5qeM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvjceWMCoz4K1meQTjI25OBodHU0xuJkNzSYicDTbKhnLaFNnwS5bhAia1WuVxMVJ55lYMR7dozdloLg8eLerga8YIItW3vJLae48/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvia6R4ibaudE2Lzumxh2xYpUsiaKsA9CsbXHiacSIytwfspQbocY9Ga2j9Flr2GJricF5icxfojPhzbTqiaCmrdVcj3Qa3wN5u7XGmEFs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>武汉岩土所是国务院学位委员会批准的首批博士、硕士学位的授予单位之一，是</span><span><span>中国科学院大学土木工程一级学科</span><span><span>牵头建设单位</span></span></span><span>，现设有土木工程一级学科、工程力学二级学科博士、硕士研究生培养点，土木水利专业硕士研究生培养点。</span><span><span>土木工程、力学2个一级学科评估均获</span><span><span>A类</span></span></span><span>。设土木工程博士后流动站1个，在站博士后100人。在所研究生550人（含联合培养239人，含留学生12人）。已培养研究生1400名，其中博士800名，硕士600名。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvhtyEYQVibaB4Sv92PNTzlMLbffXBC3HyMnx8RHe2K4HmTe5v3tvn7cpM2wl8D4t3IA4PZiaK6fiaOvjN59bPqAibOQcibLRKkfKnGs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>就业前景</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvhgUG5ZAu3sB6C68rgSbnoTG9gJDNAfnSF8vo1Z5TEZNRySDibFtUTNkCs0AxcZoiaRCgvAxbh6qwAa0QrZKbJ4CtuJRmvKfuGM8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>武汉岩土所可实现硕士、博士、博士后及海外研修/联合培养的一站式贯通。</span></strong><strong><span>毕业生就业前景良好，主要就业去向包括科研单位、高校、国有企业等。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvhR2PZ6hkicE2Ofic8gPg1cyBXYzDtJRsmBTaTxBkkYaqMicyl6FmVd5a6aq4NldMsoP3yZONAGV36icnIhGHLJpaAelkQajh1A6rY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>条件保障和文体活动</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvjgCgzmYjibIGcytnnPOA9lO8kFkDibribOLn6R4KUyRPqczuy6yaedWgS9B0Ppu8ibkiaPhqIbfE9wRGSxTEEz8pvAhKcXUriabOxSY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>武汉岩土所为研究生提供了宽敞明亮的卡座式办公室以及设施齐全的两人间公寓，全面保障了学生优越、舒适的工作与生活条件，为师生构建了集高效智慧教学、高水平学术交流与全方位身心关怀于一体的优质科研育人环境。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvgoGsibqeibiaSsPF59wFK5coRK82R0eicKn0GgiamJcFMJYOg2v6qlvNheyX2icKg7jmibYQ5SJ5xjcEyhrga7WQIZ3DYQHNaXeXvoGM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvjQytoe0EcfBEvfnFUGBCD7GfnG9618ibvjy1ZIqjQWbhI2urJup2XDrIRyzpBzx2IGQI6I6wmvNayamVjmkfrLJxFzDVA2NveE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvgWamchaGbOPg2q0LQicLh5nBMVGI3Fa2x0BeQ2bN1YtXokF4sV8ZvicBJmyLRicfmHYUzWQcZPc5H2kLgsiaPIbPlAUrpDbYwTLj0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>武汉岩土所通过举办师生联欢、研究生联谊以及“小洪山杯”系列体育赛事和花艺等特色社团活动，营造了丰富多彩、活力充沛的校园文化氛围，全面促进了师生的身心健康与情感交流。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvh8iblcVfo6sWjT7B1puia3a97gAAicuMR6I54ShebF1DEeo3OQGhibPojfr1N2FryzZFef429PDeSpyjOx4lxSbJ9UKAQgoTLdSKU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvj4HlYhrMlicDsOT5QdseXsaU30ETMqHm4SUTrS90WU1WccibI2Jt4Ell5GwWNbH6HKsYF4ic4DPucucvstjkSCvib9UB8uCeodR1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvgIFP4bR17QTXqqED7FIs0EJVwJpGlMB1GVZ0W3KWkdJv8aicIPfDe2dn9MXfq35Kc55HVvJzHeHCtwNRpNEThWuHISBR1xKV7g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nviaGgiaCdfL1Zff3AI3tTQkFsDmFwkjzSycOKHqIKEEachgZl8KK0LegqskfpTJCZuWVtwCRcC331qVJYQXNBtqItwrV8XOACOfU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>欢迎各位同学选择武汉岩土所！</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1SZ0Q6P3nvjh7CJPqZ3KSVWa9e4Wg3cLN7B91m8Xrjia5ibD7UpLtE5yl9OARQvJYt3ue